com\/s\/files\/1\/0864\/5165\/0895\/files\/Frame_102_1.jpg?v=1782006272\"\n      >\n      <img\n        class=\"cj-hero-img\"\n        src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0864\/5165\/0895\/files\/Frame_103_1.jpg?v=1782009734\"\n        alt=\"CURVJEANS anti-gap jeans for fuller hips\"\n      >\n    <\/picture>\n\n    <div class=\"cj-hero-box\">\n      <h1>5 Reasons Why Women With Fuller Hips Are Switching to CURVJEANS<\/h1>\n      <p>No waist gap, soft stretch, and a fit that still feels good at the end of the day.<\/p>\n      <div class=\"cj-down\">⌄<\/div>\n    <\/div>\n\n    <div class=\"cj-desktop-split\">\n      <div class=\"cj-split-image\">\n        <img class=\"cj-section-img\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0864\/5165\/0895\/files\/Frame_99.jpg?v=1781679226\" alt=\"Jeans with no waist gap\">\n      <\/div>\n\n      <div class=\"cj-reason beige\">\n        <h2>1. The Back Finally Sits Flat<\/h2>\n        <p>You know the gap. You bend down and the back falls open, cold air on your lower back, your hand already reaching to tug your shirt over it. On some jeans, you could fit a whole fist back there. CurveFlex™ denim is designed from scratch for a smaller waist, so the back sits flat against you. No gap, no belt, nothing to keep fixing.<\/p>\n\n        <div class=\"cj-review\">\n          <img\n            class=\"cj-review-avatar\"\n            src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0864\/5165\/0895\/files\/Untitled_design_47.jpg?v=1762872553\"\n            alt=\"CURVJEANS customer review\"\n          >\n          <div class=\"cj-review-content\">\n            <p>\"Bought these expecting to return them like all the others. The back actually sits flat. I'm shocked.\"<\/p>\n            <div class=\"cj-review-meta\">\n              — Lisa, Verified Customer\n              <img\n                src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0864\/5165\/0895\/files\/verified.webp?v=1726649878\"\n                alt=\"\"\n              >\n            <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n\n    <div class=\"cj-desktop-split reverse\">\n      <div class=\"cj-split-image\">\n        <img class=\"cj-section-img\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0864\/5165\/0895\/files\/Mid_Rise_-_Black_14.jpg?v=1780213651\" alt=\"Stretch denim jeans\">\n      <\/div>\n\n      <div class=\"cj-reason white\">\n        <h2>2. Room for Your Thighs, Snug at Your Waist<\/h2>\n        <p>Every other pair makes you choose. Size up so they fit your thighs and seat, and they swim at the waist. Fit the waist, and you can barely get them past your thighs. CurveFlex™ denim stretches over fuller thighs and hips while staying snug at the waist, so you stop choosing.<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n\n    <div class=\"cj-desktop-split\">\n      <div class=\"cj-split-image\">\n        <img class=\"cj-section-img\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0864\/5165\/0895\/files\/Frame_96_1.jpg?v=1781677110\" alt=\"CURVJEANS waistband fit\">\n      <\/div>\n\n      <div class=\"cj-reason beige\">\n        <h2>3. Soft Stretch That Still Looks Like Real Denim<\/h2>\n        <p>Stiff denim has your thighs aching by lunch and flattens everything it touches. By the time you get home, you cannot wait to peel it off. CurveFlex™ denim stretches up to 5x more than regular denim. It feels like your softest leggings and still looks like real jeans.<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n\n    <div class=\"cj-desktop-split reverse\">\n      <div class=\"cj-split-image\">\n        <img class=\"cj-section-img\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0864\/5165\/0895\/files\/Frame_101.jpg?v=1781685240\" alt=\"CURVJEANS jeans that hold their fit all day\">\n      <\/div>\n\n      <div class=\"cj-reason white\">\n        <h2>4. Fits at 9am, Still Fits at 9pm<\/h2>\n        <p>Most jeans fit in the morning, then sag by noon, and you spend the afternoon pulling them back up. CurveFlex™ denim has cotton recovery fibers that snap back and hold all day. They sit the same at 9pm as they did at 9am.<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n\n    <div class=\"cj-desktop-split\">\n      <div class=\"cj-split-image\">\n        <img class=\"cj-section-img\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0864\/5165\/0895\/files\/Frame_97.jpg?v=1781677006\" alt=\"Risk-free CURVJEANS size exchange\">\n      <\/div>\n\n      <div class=\"cj-reason beige\">\n        <h2>5. They Lift Instead of Flattening<\/h2>\n        <p>Most jeans do not leave enough room for your hips and butt, so they press everything down and give you that flat “pancake” look. CURVJEANS give your curves room, while CurveFlex™ denim hugs softly, moves with you, and shapes from behind so your curves actually show.<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/section>","background":"","background_gradient":"","text_color":""}},"custom_liquid_eNTcVD":{"type":"custom-liquid","name":"Custom Liquid","settings":{"full_width":true,"remove_vertical_spacing":true,"remove_horizontal_spacing":true,"liquid":"<section class=\"curvjeans-header-stack\" id=\"curvjeans-header-stack\">\n  <a\n    class=\"curvjeans-announcement-bar\"\n    href=\"https:\/\/curvjeans.com\/collections\/new\"\n  >\n    $30 OFF YOUR FIRST PAIR · CODE: FIRSTPAIR\n  <\/a>\n\n  <div class=\"curvjeans-custom-header\" id=\"curvjeans-header\">\n    <div class=\"curvjeans-custom-header__inner\">\n      <img \n        src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0864\/5165\/0895\/files\/CURVJEANS-06_2.svg?v=1736424968\" \n        alt=\"CURVJEANS\" \n        class=\"curvjeans-custom-header__logo\" \n      >\n\n      {% capture shop_url %}\n        {% if request.path contains '\/de' %}\n          https:\/\/curvjeans.com\/de\/collections\/all-products\n        {% elsif request.path contains '\/nl' %}\n          https:\/\/curvjeans.com\/nl\/collections\/all-products\n        {% else %}\n          https:\/\/curvjeans.com\/collections\/all-products\n        {% 